	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you select this archetype at 3rd level, you gain proficiency in Engineering, or an expertise die if you were already proficient. You have advantage on checks related to assessing fortifications and their defenses.</p><p>Additionally,  choose one of the following.</p><h2>Offensive Defense</h2><p>You know a good offense is linked to a good defense. You may make an attack with your shield as a bonus action. Additionally, you may apply your proficiency bonus to attacks made with your shield.</p><h2>Defensive Maneuvers</h2><p>Walls may be the best fortification, but you know how to create one on the go. You learn the Shield Wall maneuver, and it does not count against the number of maneuvers you know. Once per long rest, you may activate this maneuver without expending exertion.</p>",
